 "observations": [
  "body L1-L17: the comparison of the measures, begun on p. 167, concluded; a brace joins the two measures of the Maeotic Lake in the second column, with «paulo minor Ponto.» between them in the third. Every degree in brackets is the number of miles divided by 75, exactly (1060 miles = 14° 2/15, 1300 = 17° 1/3, 1800 = 24°).",
  "body L24-L29: a second, smaller comparison in the same columns; the call of note 5, which concerns the 59 islands of al-Battānī (L28), is not printed.",
  "body L35: Nallino's addenda et emendanda (Part I, p. LXXII) correct «extensione» (the third line from the foot) to extensionis; kept as printed.",
  "notes_left L9: a semicolon is printed after «ries»."
 ],
